{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_design_00_onboarding_seed_money", "label": "\ucd08\uae30 \uc528\ub4dc\uba38\ub2c8 1,000\uc6d0", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "## \ucd08\uae30 \uc0c1\ud0dc \uc9c0\uae09 (\uac00\uc785 \uc989\uc2dc)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Quest 1 itself is building a 1,000\uc6d0 T1 factory. Without seed money the player could not even start the first quest, so the minimum seed is granted at /start. Maps to User.money default 1000 (BigInt)."}, {"id": "docs_design_00_onboarding_initial_state_grant", "label": "\uac00\uc785 \uc989\uc2dc \ucd08\uae30 \uc0c1\ud0dc \uc9c0\uae09 (\uc790\uae08\u00b7\ud1a0\uc9c0\u00b7\ucc3d\uace0\u00b7\ud29c\ud1a0\ub9ac\uc5bc)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "## \ucd08\uae30 \uc0c1\ud0dc \uc9c0\uae09 (\uac00\uc785 \uc989\uc2dc)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_00_onboarding_tutorial_quest_chain", "label": "\ud29c\ud1a0\ub9ac\uc5bc \ud018\uc2a4\ud2b8 \uccb4\uc778 (5\ub2e8\uacc4)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "## \ud29c\ud1a0\ub9ac\uc5bc \ud018\uc2a4\ud2b8 \uccb4\uc778", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_00_onboarding_q4_funding", "label": "Q4 \uc5c5\uadf8\ub808\uc774\ub4dc \uc790\uae08 \uc870\ub2ec (\ubaa8\uc21c 11 \ud655\uc815, #21 \uacb0\uc815 2)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "#### Q4 \uc790\uae08 \uc870\ub2ec (\ubaa8\uc21c 11 \ud655\uc815 \u2014 #21 \uacb0\uc815 2)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Quest 4 needs 3,000\uc6d0 but quest rewards alone only accumulate 2,000\uc6d0. Closing the gap by harvesting and selling is declared the intended path \u2014 Q3 also completes via an instant global sale, which pays cash immediately, and a grade-1 farm yields 300\uc6d0/tick so 1,000\uc6d0 arrives in 4 ticks (40 min). Since Q4 has no time limit the real risk is onboarding stalling, not insolvency, so the acceptance criterion is self-funding time <= 60 minutes, verified by checkTutorialQuestFunding (measured 40 min)."}, {"id": "docs_design_00_onboarding_base_price", "label": "\uc790\uc7ac \uae30\uc900\uac00 (Base Price) \ud14c\uc774\ube14", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "## \uc790\uc7ac \uae30\uc900\uac00 (Base Price) \u2014 \uacbd\uc81c \uc2dc\uc2a4\ud15c \uae30\ubc18\uac12", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without base prices the whole economy is unverifiable: direct-buy pricing, upgrade-cost adequacy and market price bands all derive from these values. T1 prices are chosen so each T1 factory converges to 300~400\uc6d0 per tick regardless of output rate, which also fixes the 1,000\uc6d0 build cost payback at ~3.3 ticks (33 min). GlobalMarketPrice.basePrice must match this table."}, {"id": "docs_design_00_onboarding_breakeven", "label": "T1 \uacf5\uc7a5 \uc190\uc775\ubd84\uae30\uc810 33\ubd84", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "### T1 \uc790\uc7ac \uae30\uc900\uac00", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_00_onboarding_tier_value", "label": "\ud2f0\uc5b4\uc758 \uac00\uce58 (\ubaa8\uc21c 7 \ud655\uc815, #21 \uacb0\uc815 3)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "### \ud2f0\uc5b4\uc758 \uac00\uce58 (\ubaa8\uc21c 7 \ud655\uc815 \u2014 #21 \uacb0\uc815 3)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The claim that T2/T3 earn 2~3x T1 is abandoned: the balance simulator (#31) shows it neither holds nor can be made to hold. T3 occupies 2x2 slots, so per-factory and per-slot multiples always diverge by exactly 4x; forcing a 2x per-slot ratio would require raising car base price from 500 to ~6,300\uc6d0, which pushes per-factory to 15.35x and violates the same cap. No base-price combination satisfies both metrics, so tier value is redefined as warehouse volume efficiency, late-game sink monopoly, stock listing eligibility and XP/unlock gating, with profit multiples kept only as a regression reference metric."}, {"id": "docs_design_00_onboarding_unresolved_items", "label": "\uc628\ubcf4\ub529 \ubbf8\uacb0\uc815 \uc0ac\ud56d (/start vs /register, \uc7ac\uac00\uc785 \uc815\ucc45, \ud29c\ud1a0\ub9ac\uc5bc \uc2a4\ud0b5)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "## \ubbf8\uacb0\uc815 \uc0ac\ud56d", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_00_onboarding_user_tutorialstep", "label": "User.tutorialStep (0~5)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "## \uad00\ub828 \uc2a4\ud0a4\ub9c8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "packages_game_core_src_simulation_targets_checktutorialquestfunding", "label": "checkTutorialQuestFunding", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "#### Q4 \uc790\uae08 \uc870\ub2ec", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "packages_game_core_src_simulation_targets_checktiermultiplier", "label": "checkTierMultiplier", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/design/00-onboarding.md", "source_location": "### \ud2f0\uc5b4\uc758 \uac00\uce58", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_design_00_onboarding_initial_state_grant", "target": "docs_design_00_onboarding_s